    "Daily" : {

    },
    "HealthKitが利用できません" : {
      "comment" : "Error message shown when HealthKit is unavailable",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "HealthKit is not available"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "HealthKit 不可用"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "iOSの仕組みにより、ウィジェットの歩数は１時間に１回程度更新されます" : {
      "comment" : "Widget update frequency note",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Due to iOS behavior, widget step counts update approximately once per hour"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "由于 iOS 系统限制，小组件步数大约每小时更新一次"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "iOSの制限により、バッテリーを低電力モードにしている場合は更新がされません" : {
      "comment" : "Widget low power mode note",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Due to iOS restrictions, updates are paused when Low Power Mode is enabled"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "由于 iOS 限制，开启低电量模式时将暂停更新"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Strideは一目で歩数データを確認できる美しいアプリです" : {
      "comment" : "Welcome screen description",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "A beautiful app to check your step data at a glance"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "一款美观的应用，让您一目了然地查看步数数据"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Strideは歩数データを活用して、毎日の活動を記録します。次の画面でヘルスケアとの連携を許可してください。\nヘルスケアデータは端末内でのみ使用されます。" : {
      "comment" : "Authorization request explanation text",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Stride uses your step data to track your daily activity. Please allow Health access on the next screen.\nHealth data is only used on your device."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Stride 使用您的步数数据记录每日活动。请在下一屏幕允许访问健康数据。\n健康数据仅在您的设备上使用。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Strideへようこそ！" : {
      "comment" : "Welcome screen title",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Welcome to Stride!"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "欢迎使用 Stride！"
          }
        }
      }
    },
